# --- Demo showcase (curated media + profiling committed on the demo branch) ---
# Override the broad ignores above for everything under docs/demo/.
# Raw Nsight reports (*.nsys-rep / *.ncu-rep) stay OUT of git to keep the repo
# lean — transfer them with scripts/cloud/save-artifacts.sh and commit only the
# exported timeline PNG + CSV summaries. Use `git add -f` to commit a raw report.
!docs/demo/**
!docs/demo/**/*.png
!docs/demo/**/*.jpg
!docs/demo/**/*.gif
!docs/demo/**/*.mp4
!docs/demo/**/*.webm
!docs/demo/**/*.csv
!docs/demo/**/*.svg

# Keep raw Nsight reports out of git even under docs/demo (re-ignore after the
# broad !docs/demo/** rule above). Commit exported PNG/CSV instead, or `git add -f`.
docs/demo/**/*.nsys-rep
docs/demo/**/*.ncu-rep
docs/demo/**/*.qdstrm
docs/demo/**/*.qdrep
docs/demo/**/*.sqlite
